                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "FREAKING AWESOME!  I've been doing graffiti for over 13+yrs and I gotta say \"The experience was great!\" I freaking loved it! I ended up Spray painting a pretty cool piece! Check out the Vive Spray video I made: \nhttps://youtu.be/_lf4Nfb5ez8\n\nThanks again to the creators of this game for such an amazing experience it was super cool, and it has definitely became one of my favorite games on here! Thanks! I'm happy with the game as it is to be honest! Though I gotta say I wasn't a huge fan of the Color selection tool, it was still super cool! but I think it could be better! would like to see where this game is headed being an early access game and all! it has alot of potential!",
